{"sha": "3accc8d1d5ec8629e038a21ae4c137de0f6151200dfdcadc1b5534afe8840963", "body": ["\\begin{definition}[立体专一反应]\\label{def:b1:nucleophilic-substitution:stereospecific}", "若立体异构的底物各自给出立体异构不同的产物，", "即每个底物各给出自己的产物，则称该反应为", "\\emph{立体专一反应}\\index{立体专一反应}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\section{SN1 机理}", "", "2-溴-2-甲基丙烷与水反应，其速率不依赖于亲核试剂的浓度，", "即 $v = k[(\\ce{CH3})_3\\ce{CBr}]$。", "因此决定速率的必定是一个不涉及亲核试剂的步骤。", "", "\\begin{definition}[SN1 机理、外消旋化、溶剂解]\\label{def:b1:nucleophilic-substitution:sn1}", "\\emph{SN1 机理}\\index{SN1 机理}（取代、亲核、单分子）", "包含两步：先是 C--Y 键的慢速异裂，生成", "碳正离子，随后亲核试剂快速加成到碳正离子上。", "把单一对映异构体转化为两者混合物的反应，称为", "\\emph{外消旋化}\\index{外消旋化}；", "以溶剂作为亲核试剂的取代反应，称为", "\\emph{溶剂解}\\index{溶剂解}。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\setchemfig{atom sep=2.1em}", "\\schemestart", "\\chemfig{C(-[2]CH_3)(-[4]H_3C)(-[6]CH_3)-[@{cb2}]@{br2}Br}", "\\arrow{->[慢]}", "\\chemfig{C^{+}(-[2]CH_3)(-[:210]H_3C)(-[:-30]CH_3)}", "\\+", "\\chemfig{Br^{-}}", "\\schemestop", "", "\\smallskip", "\\schemestart", "\\chemfig{C^{+}(-[2]CH_3)(-[:210]H_3C)(-[:-30]CH_3)}", "\\arrow{->[快][\\ce{H2O}]}", "\\chemfig{C(-[2]CH_3)(-[4]H_3C)(-[6]CH_3)-OH_2^{+}}", "\\arrow{->[\\ce{-H+}]}", "\\chemfig{C(-[2]CH_3)(-[4]H_3C)(-[6]CH_3)-OH}", "\\schemestop", "\\chemmove{\\draw[->, thick, shorten <=2pt](cb2) .. controls +(90:6mm) and +(90:6mm) .. (br2);}", "", "\\medskip", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small]", "  \\fill[omProp!15, draw=omProp] (0,0.2) ellipse (0.2 and 0.85);", "  \\fill[omProp!15, draw=omProp] (0,-0.2) ellipse (0.2 and 0.85);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (-1.1,-0.2) node[left] {\\ce{CH3}};", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (0.95,-0.45) node[right] {\\ce{C2H5}};", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (0.4,0.5) node[above right] {H};", "  \\node[fill=white, inner sep=1pt] at (0,0) {\\ce{C+}};", "  \\draw[->, thick, omDef] (-0.9,1.6) node[left] {\\ce{H2O}} -- (-0.15,0.95);", "  \\draw[->, thick, omDef] (0.9,-1.6) node[right] {\\ce{H2O}} -- (0.15,-0.95);", "  \\node[align=center] at (4.6,0) {从任一面进攻：\\\\ 两种构型都生成，\\\\ 若两面之间无其他差别，\\\\ 则为外消旋混合物};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 2-溴-2-甲基丙烷在水中的 SN1 溶剂解：慢速电离", "生成叔碳正离子，随后被水捕获并失去一个质子。", "另一例：由 2-溴丁烷生成的手性仲碳正离子为平面结构，", "水从任一面加成的概率相等。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[SN1 的速率方程]\\label{prop:b1:nucleophilic-substitution:sn1-law}", "对于 SN1 机理，若碳正离子被捕获的速度远快于", "它回到底物的速度，则 $v = k_1[\\mathrm{RY}]$，", "且与亲核试剂无关。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "步骤：$\\mathrm{RY} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{R^+} + \\mathrm{Y^-}$（$k_1$，", "$k_{-1}$），$\\mathrm{R^+} + \\mathrm{Nu} \\to \\mathrm{RNu}$（$k_2$）。", "碳正离子是一种活性中间体，由稳态近似", "（见\\cref{ch:b1:elementary-steps}）可得 $k_1[\\mathrm{RY}] =", "k_{-1}[\\mathrm{R^+}][\\mathrm{Y^-}] + k_2[\\mathrm{R^+}][\\mathrm{Nu}]$，于是", "$v = k_2[\\mathrm{R^+}][\\mathrm{Nu}] = \\dfrac{k_1k_2[\\mathrm{RY}][\\mathrm{Nu}]}", "{k_{-1}[\\mathrm{Y^-}] + k_2[\\mathrm{Nu}]}$。当 $k_2[\\mathrm{Nu}] \\gg", "k_{-1}[\\mathrm{Y^-}]$ 时，上式化为 $k_1[\\mathrm{RY}]$，即第一步为", "决速步。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[SN1 的立体化学]\\label{prop:b1:nucleophilic-substitution:sn1-stereo}", "SN1 反应发生在手性碳原子上时，同时生成两种构型：", "该反应不具有立体专一性，并在", "碳正离子两面无差别时导致外消旋化。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "碳正离子为平面结构（见\\cref{ch:b1:electronic-effects}），其两个面", "互为镜像。若离去基团在捕获之前已远离，", "则亲核试剂以相同速率从任一面加成，得到", "两种等量的对映异构体。实际上，离去的离子仍会", "在一段时间内屏蔽其中一个面，因而常观察到", "略多的瓦尔登翻转产物。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[", "  width=0.8\\linewidth, height=5.0cm, xmin=0, xmax=10, ymin=-30, ymax=110,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={反应坐标},", "  ylabel={能量}, xtick=\\empty, ytick=\\empty,", "  label style={font=\\small}, legend style={font=\\scriptsize, draw=none, at={(0.98,0.98)}, anchor=north east}]", "\\addplot[omDef, very thick] table[x=x, y=E] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-energy-profiles-sn2.dat};", "\\addplot[omProp, very thick, dashed] table[x=x, y=E] {figdata/out/bachelor-1-energy-profiles-sn1.dat};", "\\legend{SN2：一步，SN1：两步}", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (axis cs:5,68) {碳正离子};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (axis cs:0.6,-3) {底物 RY};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south] at (axis cs:9.6,-18) {产物 RNu};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}